/E (Akira Toriyama is world-famous as the creator of Dragon Ball. People know Goku and Vegeta as well as Superman and Wolverine. But there's a huge side to Toriyama that flies over the head of anime fans. The side that would appeal directly to the G-FEST crowd: The side that was a kaiju-sized fan of giant monster movies. This panel will delve into the many times Akira Toriyama referenced the world of kaiju eiga in his manga over the course of his career, with homages to Ultraman, Gamera, and of course, the King of the Monsters himself!)
