/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 155 0 R
/E (In 2017, an ambitious movie landed in Japan: BraveStorm, a reboot of Super Robot Red Baron and Silver Kamen. It could have launched a cinematic universe, but nothing ever came of it. What happened? Is BraveStorm a hidden gem or enjoyably bad? And what could the BraveStorm universe have looked like had it become reality? Ryan Goerge Collins \(Omni Viewer, author\) and Nathan Marchand \(The Monster Island Film Vault, author\) will answer these questions and more as they guide you through this forgotten reboot and speculate about what could have been.)
